---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '../../styles/workspace.css';
---
<BaseLayout title="写作台 · 窗边手记" description="保存草稿、提交手记，管理员审核与管理文章。">
  <header class="article-nav wrap member-nav"><a href="/">← 回到窗边手记</a><div><a href="/notes/">全部手记</a><a href="/account/">我的账户</a><button type="button" data-theme-toggle aria-label="切换深浅主题">☼</button></div></header>
  <main id="main-content" class="wrap member-page workspace-page" data-workspace-page>
    <div class="workspace-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE WRITING DESK</p><h1>把想法，写成一页。</h1><p id="workspace-greeting">一张安静的写作台，等待你的下一段文字。</p></div><span id="workspace-role" class="member-badge" hidden></span></div>
    <div id="transport-notice" class="member-notice" hidden><strong>请使用安全连接写作</strong><p>登录与文章管理需要 HTTPS。<a id="secure-account-link" href="https://152.136.191.171:8088/workspace/">打开安全连接 ↗</a></p></div>
    <p id="workspace-status" class="member-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">正在打开写作台…</p>
    <div id="workspace-auth-notice" class="workspace-empty" hidden><span aria-hidden="true">✎</span><h2>先登录，再落笔。</h2><p>登录后可以保存草稿与提交手记。管理员可以编辑、发布文章并处理投稿。</p><a class="member-button" href="/account/">登录 / 注册 →</a></div>
    <div id="workspace-app" class="workspace-grid" hidden>
      <aside class="workspace-sidebar"><div class="workspace-list-heading"><h2 id="post-list-title">我的手记</h2><button type="button" id="new-post-button" class="member-button compact">＋ 新建</button></div><label for="post-filter" class="field-note">查看状态</label><select id="post-filter"><option value="all">全部手记</option><option value="draft">草稿</option><option value="pending">等待审核</option><option value="published">已发布</option><option value="rejected">需要修改</option></select><p id="post-list-count" class="field-note"></p><div id="workspace-post-list" class="workspace-post-list" aria-label="手记列表"></div><p class="desk-tip">写作小提示：<kbd>Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd>S</kbd> 保存草稿。点击「预览」查看排版效果。</p></aside>
      <section class="workspace-editor" aria-label="文章编辑器">
        <div class="editor-heading"><div><h2 id="editor-heading">新的一页</h2><p id="editor-state" class="field-note">填写标题和正文，保存你的第一篇草稿。</p></div><a id="editor-public-link" class="editor-public-link" href="/notes/" hidden>阅读公开版本 ↗</a></div>
        <div id="review-feedback" class="member-notice" hidden><strong>审核反馈</strong><p id="review-feedback-text"></p></div>
        <form id="editor-form" class="member-form editor-form"><label for="post-title">标题</label><input id="post-title" name="title" required minlength="2" maxlength="140" placeholder="给这一页起个名字" /><label for="post-description">导语</label><textarea id="post-description" name="description" rows="2" required maxlength="360" placeholder="用一两句话，告诉读者这里写了什么。"></textarea><div class="editor-meta-fields"><div><label for="post-category">分类</label><select id="post-category" name="category"><option>工程实践</option><option>AI 与研究</option><option>学习记录</option><option>生活随笔</option></select></div><div><label for="post-tags">标签</label><input id="post-tags" name="tags" maxlength="200" placeholder="学习, 灵感, 小发现" /><small>用逗号分隔，最多 8 个标签。</small></div></div><div class="editor-body-heading"><label for="post-markdown">正文 · Markdown</label><div class="editor-view-tabs" role="group" aria-label="编辑或预览"><button type="button" id="write-view-button" aria-pressed="true">写作</button><button type="button" id="preview-button" aria-pressed="false">预览</button></div></div><div id="markdown-toolbar" class="markdown-toolbar" role="toolbar" aria-label="Markdown 格式"><button type="button" data-format="heading" aria-label="插入二级标题">H2</button><button type="button" data-format="bold" aria-label="加粗选中的文字"><strong>B</strong></button><button type="button" data-format="italic" aria-label="斜体选中的文字"><em>I</em></button><button type="button" data-format="link">链接</button><button type="button" data-format="quote">引用</button><button type="button" data-format="list">列表</button><button type="button" data-format="code">代码</button><span id="editor-word-count">0 字</span></div><textarea id="post-markdown" name="markdown" class="markdown-input" rows="18" required spellcheck="false" placeholder="从一个小小的想法开始…"></textarea><div id="markdown-preview" class="prose markdown-preview" tabindex="0" hidden></div><p id="publish-guidance" class="submission-note">草稿只有你能看到。提交后等待管理员审核，通过后会出现在公共博客。</p><div class="editor-actions"><button type="submit" class="member-button secondary" id="save-draft-button" data-editor-action="draft">保存草稿</button><button type="submit" class="member-button" id="submit-post-button" data-editor-action="submit">提交审核 →</button><button type="submit" class="member-button" id="publish-post-button" data-editor-action="publish" hidden>发布文章 →</button><button type="button" class="member-button danger" id="delete-post-button" hidden>删除</button></div></form>
        <section id="moderation-panel" class="moderation-panel" hidden aria-label="审核当前投稿"><h3>审核这篇投稿</h3><p>确认内容合适后发布；需要修改时，留下具体的反馈。</p><label for="moderation-feedback">给作者的反馈</label><textarea id="moderation-feedback" rows="3" maxlength="1000" placeholder="例如：补充复现步骤和来源链接后，可以再次提交。"></textarea><div class="editor-actions"><button id="approve-post-button" class="member-button" type="button">审核通过并发布</button><button id="reject-post-button" class="member-button secondary" type="button">退回修改</button></div></section><section id="unpublish-panel" class="moderation-panel" hidden><p>撤下后文章不再公开，内容会保留在写作台。</p><button type="button" id="unpublish-post-button" class="member-button secondary">撤下公开文章</button></section>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
  <script>import '../../scripts/workspace.ts';</script>
</BaseLayout>
